#!name=QQ音乐去广告
#!desc=可莉域名拦截及原有广告统计补充；无需 MitM
#!author=可莉[https://github.com/luestr/ProxyResource/blob/main/README.md]
#!icon=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/luestr/IconResource/main/App_icon/120px/QQMusic.png
# QQ音乐去广告
# Source: https://kelee.one/Tool/Loon/Lpx/QQMusic_remove_ads.lpx
#!qx_version=1.5.2-854
# Shared source: https://kelee.one/Tool/Loon/Lpx/BlockAdvertisers.lpx
# Generated by loon2qx. See README for compatibility limits.
# 已并入本 App 的广告/统计域名配套；来源和分配见 config/shared-scope.json。
# 原作者：可莉；14 条域名拦截 + 1 条针对已拦截域名的 HTTP 兼容重写，无脚本或 MitM。
# 纯域名版在用户 QX 1.90 中报内容无效；此混合资源为兼容修正版，待手机导入验证。
# 添加到重写资源，关闭资源解析器；与 lists/qqmusic.list 二选一，不要重复订阅。
^http:\/\/ad\.tencentmusic\.com\/ url reject
host, tmeadcomm.y.qq.com, reject
host, stat.y.qq.com, reject
host, stat6.y.qq.com, reject
host, adstats.tencentmusic.com, reject
host, ad.tencentmusic.com, reject
host, adcdn.tencentmusic.com, reject
host, adcdn6.tencentmusic.com, reject
host, adexpo.tencentmusic.com, reject
host, adclick.tencentmusic.com, reject
host, mc.tencentmusic.com, reject
host, monitor.music.qq.com, reject
host, tmead.y.qq.com, reject
host, tmeadbak.y.qq.com, reject
host, tmeadquic.y.qq.com, reject
